    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1262">

                <pb facs="1076" n="972" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg972"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.1215/452.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams—Paraphrases.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-01-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 30, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am informed by the Minister for Foreign Affairs that the Chamizal matter will
                    be taken up through the Mexican Embassy and can be disregarded here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
